"executor_action","launch":"c748722a-adb0-45ce-bf96-7da90f0031a4","task":"T-075-4","attempt":"8a86522c-773d-4f55-af30-fea13448eeb2","data":{"action":"initial_release","reason":"主控 #41 / 决定02：放行一个回合，以PTY字节增长取证","source":"executor","process_info":{"shell_pid":95310,"leader":95311,"native_session":null,"processes":[{"pid":95310,"ppid":95246,"pgid":95310,"tpgid":95311,"command":"/bin/zsh"},{"pid":95311,"ppid":95310,"pgid":95311,"tpgid":95311,"command":"/Users/luckye/.codex/packages/standalone/releases/0.162.1-aarch64-apple-darwin/bin/codex"}],"failed":null}}},{"seq":24,"time":"2026-10-11T07:54:36.995Z","type":"paste_intent","launch":"c748722a-adb0-45ce-bf96-7da90f0031a4","task":"T-075-4","attempt":"8a86522c-773d-4f55-af30-fea13448eeb2","data":{"dispatch":"9e3a7df8-10aa-4cf6-a869-ee65ad45414f","text":"⟦主控 #1⟧\n# 角色卡：worker\n\n2026-10-09，随 [spec](../specs/controller-split-user-input-2026-10-09.md) 生效。你是干净上下文的执行 agent，只做分配给你的 task/attempt。\n\n**做**\n\n- 按[任务卡](../templates/task-card.md)的范围实现，显式 submit，不靠\"我做完了\"。\n- 发现范围外的问题时上报，不要自己决定忽略，也不要顺手去修。例如：spec 与代码不符、验收条件看起来有缺陷、任务卡与 AGENTS.md 冲突、你不确定该不该做的事。\n  - Herdr 期：`scripts/inbox send --from worker:<你的 agent 名> --to triage --kind issue --title \"<一句话标题>\" --body-file <正文文件> [--blocking] [--ref file:路径#L行号]`\n  - 新工作台里：由编排后台提供同一个命令，切换时更新本卡。\n- 上报默认不阻塞，上报后继续你的工作。只有真的必须等用户才能继续时才加 `--blocking`，并停下等答复。\n- 正文写清：看到了什么，在哪里（文件与行号），为什么觉得是问题，你建议怎么办。\n- 收到形如\"问题 N：…… / 用户答复：……\"的消息，是用户对你上报的问题的答复，按它办。若末尾附有\"（另：你上报的问题 N 已被关闭，理由：……）\"，不同意可以重新上报并补充证据。\n- 需要用户立刻回答才能继续的事，Codex 自带的提问界面照旧可用。\n\n**不做**\n\n- 不扩大范围；不改 AGENTS.md、CONTEXT.md、地图和他人的 ticket；不动别的任务的 attempt。\n- 不把\"我觉得不重要\"当成不上报的理由。\n\n\n{\n  \"id\": \"T-075-4\",\n  \"source\": {\n    \"ticket\": \"/private/tmp/a2a4src-y43b2oof/source/.project-map/tickets/T-075-tracer-bullet-daemon-gate-pane.md\",\n    \"ready_rev\": 4\n  },\n  \"goal\": \"这是独立的窗口生命周期和运行中断验收夹具，不是编排产品开发任务。只在当前 worktree 用执行工具运行 /bin/zsh -f wait.zsh。脚本已经准备好，只执行一个90秒的sleep；不读取或改写脚本。执行工具每次等待约 1000ms；脚本未退出就继续读取同一个工具会话的输出，每次等待不超过10秒。保持这个主回合运行，等待执行主控从外部停止后台来制造中断。这张夹具任务不进入完成交付阶段：不 git add、不 git commit、不 submit、不写交付请求文件。不要查看凭据、全局配置或a2a源码，不发网络请求，不启动子agent，不主动结束主回合。\",\n  \"non_goals\": [\n    \"不实现产品，不完成或提交这张中断夹具任务，不操作任何其他会话\"\n  ],\n  \"paths\": {\n    \"allow\": [\n      \"scratch/\"\n    ],\n    \"deny\": [\n      \"wait.zsh\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"completion_conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"argv\": [\n        \"/Library/Developer/CommandLineTools/Library/Frameworks/Python3.framework/Versions/3.9/bin/python3.9\",\n        \"-I\",\n        \"-B\",\n        \"-c\",\n        \"raise SystemExit(23)\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"red_commands\": [],\n  \"task_type\": \"测试\",\n  \"repair_target\": null,\n  \"complexity\": \"M\",\n  \"executor\": {\n    \"cli\": \"Codex\",\n    \"model\": \"gpt-6.1-sol\",\n    \"effort\": \"xhigh\"\n  },\n  \"base_commit\": \"eea5066370de73735be3cae2f5b44fa7f4d76fcf\",\n  \"writer\": {\n    \"task_id\": \"T-075-4\",\n    \"attempt_id\": \"8a86522c-773d-4f55-af30-fea13448eeb2\",\n    \"session_id\": \"4d80059a-bdde-4364-ba02-4aedd58fba91\",\n    \"fence\": 1,\n    \"thread_id\": \"f20e2007-9f1a-414b-9765-28eeba0d594c\"\n  }\n}\n\n受管身份：{\"command\":\"submit\",\"task\":\"T-075-4\",\"attempt\":\"8a86522c-773d-4f55-af30-fea13448eeb2\",\"session\":\"4d80059a-bdde-4364-ba02-4aedd58fba91\",\"fence\":1,\"spec_rev\":1,\"commit\":\"<FULL_COMMIT_SHA>\"}\nGit 写操作：把执行工具的工作目录设为本 attempt 的 worktree。git add <路径> 和 git commit … 必须各自作为一条独立的工具命令执行；不要与 cd、检查命令或彼此用 &&、分号、管道、换行、变量赋值或重定向拼接。git status、git diff、测试和 git rev-parse 另行执行。两条 Git 前缀 allow 规则只授权对应命令；若独立执行仍被沙箱拒绝，上报问题并结束，不重试或修改权限。\n完成并 Git 提交后，把 FULL_COMMIT_SHA 换成完整提交号，运行以下 CLI 显式交付：\n'/opt/homebrew/Cellar/node/26.5.0/bin/node' '/private/tmp/a2a4src-y43b2oof/source/workbench/src/gates/cli.ts' '--state' '/private/tmp/a4live-k4isyviu/state' 'submit' '--task' 'T-075-4' '--attempt' '8a86522c-773d-4f55-af30-fea13448eeb2' '--session' '4d80059a-bdde-4364-ba02-4aedd58fba91' '--fence' '1' '--spec-rev' '1' '--commit' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":25,"time":"2026-10-11T07:54:36.995Z","type":"paste_written","launch":"c748722a-adb0-45ce-bf96-7da90f0031a4","task":"T-075-4","attempt":"8a86522c-773d-4f55-af30-fea13448eeb2","data":{"dispatch":"9e3a7df8-10aa-4cf6-a869-ee65ad45414f"}},{"seq":26,"time":"2026-10-11T07:54:37.296Z","type":"turn_submit_intent","launch":"c748722a-adb0-45ce-bf96-7da90f0031a4","task":"T-075-4","attempt":"8a86522c-773d-4f55-af30-fea13448eeb2","data":{"id":"ec1c2a27-01f1-486b-801e-a91bca7441c0","dispatch":"9e3a7df8-10aa-4cf6-a869-ee65ad45414f","at":"2026-10-11T07:54:36.995Z","nativeTurn":null}},{"seq":27,"time":"2026-10-11T07:54:37.296Z","type":"turn_submitted","launch":"c748722a-adb0-45ce-bf96-7da90f0031a4","task":"T-075-4","attempt":"8a86522c-773d-4f55-af30-fea13448eeb2","data":{"id":"ec1c2a27-01f1-486b-801e-a91bca7441c0","dispatch":"9e3a7df8-10aa-4cf6-a869-ee65ad45414f","at":"2026-10-11T07:54:36.995Z","nativeTurn":null}},{"seq":28,"time":"2026-10-11T07:54:37.296Z","type":"request_result","launch":null,"task":null,"attempt":null,"data":{"id":"57ada3dc-4703-4181-9534-37aa6f24e2a4","command":"pane_release","ok":true}},{"seq":29,"time":"2026-10-11T07:54:37.424Z","type":"request_received","launch":null,"task":null,"attempt":null,"data":{"id":"1011fdbe-fa62-47f1-a56f-8ac2597dc471","input":{"command":"pane_status","thread":"f20e2007-9f1a-414b-9765-28eeba0d594c"},"source":"executor"}},{"seq":30,"time":"2026-10-11T07:54:37.425Z","type":"request_result","launch":null,"task":null,"attempt":null,"data":{"id":"1011fdbe-fa62-47f1-a56f-8ac2597dc471","command":"pane_status","ok":true}},{"seq":31,"time":"2026-10-11T07:54:37.906Z","type":"request_received","launch":null,"task":null,"attempt":null,"data":{"id":"749b5d45-d3f8-46c2-8449-6743fe70a84a","input":{"command":"pane